    "Titles": {
        "eng": "The Invisible Man and His Soon-to-Be Wife",
        "jpn": "透明男と人間女～そのうち夫婦になるふたり～"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Akira Tounome is an invisible gentleman who runs a detective agency, and Shizuka Yakō is a mild-mannered human female who works there. Shizuka can always find Akira even when he turns completely invisible. A quiet love begins to blossom between them as the invisible man and blind girl grow closer to each other…",
        "jpn": "探偵事務所を構える紳士な「透明男」の透乃眼あきらと\r\nその事務所に勤めるおっとりした「人間女性」の夜香しずか。\r\n\r\n透明に姿を消しても、目の見えない夜香には\r\n不思議と透乃眼の居場所がわかってしまう。\r\n\r\n“見えない”ふたりは、いつしか互いに惹かれ合い…？"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Tōmei Otoko to Ningen Onna: Sonouchi Fūfu ni Naru Futari",
        "Toumei Otoko to Ningen Onna: Sonouchi Fuufu ni Naru Futari",
        "Invisible Man & Human Lady",
        "The Invisible Man and the Human Woman: Two People Who Will Soon Become Husband and Wife"
    ],
